<headline>TABLE - Thermo Cardiosystems Q2 shr $0.06.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Cardiosystems Inc. Financial Highlights</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended   Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		   June 28,	June 29,   June 28,     June 29,</p>
<p>		    1997	    1996	 1997	    1996</p>
<p>Revenues  $15,931,000  $15,893,000  $30,833,000 $31,298,000</p>
<p>Income Before</p>
