<p> Income Taxes  3,639,000    5,759,000    6,712,000  10,981,000</p>
<p>    Net Income 2,222,000    3,573,000    4,097,000   7,004,000</p>
<p>    EPSe		 .06	    .09	    .10	   .17</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares</p>
<p>		  39,635,000   39,817,000   39,945,000  40,909,000</p>
<p>&quot;Although revenues for the quarter were flat compared with last year,  unit sales of our HeartMate(R) pump were up 32 percent over the first  quarter of this year,&quot; said Victor L. Poirier, president and chief  executive officer of Thermo Cardiosystems.  &quot;We have submitted over  10,000 pages of data to the FDA for review of our electric device  as a bridge to transplant, and hope to receive market approval this  year.</p>
